WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:12.039
When Mr.

2
00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:13.300
Havisham received Mr.

3
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.560
Bennington's letter, he hurried to the castle.

4
00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:21.142
he said to the earl.

5
00:00:21.162 --> 00:00:26.444
"We finally have some solid proof that this boy is an imposter."

6
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.941
The earl read Mr.

7
00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:32.023
Bennington's letter and looked at the newspaper photo.

8
00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:36.327
"This will be the end of that dreadful woman!"

9
00:00:37.368 --> 00:00:40.370
"She was definitely married to Bevis," Mr.

10
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.291
Havisham said.

11
00:00:41.311 --> 00:00:45.534
"But I believe her son is older than she says."

12
00:00:45.554 --> 00:00:48.236
"What are you going to do next?"

13
00:00:48.717 --> 00:00:49.938
the earl asked.

14
00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:55.382
"I'll send a cable to Ben and Dick, asking them to come as soon as possible.

15
00:00:56.423 --> 00:01:01.944
I imagine Minna—that's her real name—will be surprised and dismayed to see them."

16
00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:06.228
Mr. Havisham chuckled.

17
00:01:06.248 --> 00:01:12.053
"Meanwhile I'll keep pretending that I'm not suspicious of her!"

18
00:01:15.095 --> 00:01:16.036
One morning Mr.

19
00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.439
Havisham and the earl arrived in Minna's sitting room at the inn.

20
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.404
She was sitting on the sofa, making a list of clothes she required.

21
00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:31.702
"The earl and I have brought some old friends to see you," the lawyer said.

22
00:01:31.722 --> 00:01:33.903
"Old friends?"

23
00:01:34.823 --> 00:01:36.804
Minna gave him a suspicious look.

24
00:01:36.824 --> 00:01:42.447
"More than friends—family," said Ben, entering the room.

25
00:01:44.407 --> 00:01:47.769
Minna sprang to her feet and cried out in alarm.

26
00:01:47.789 --> 00:01:51.170
"I never expected to see you again!"

27
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.092
Mr. Havisham glanced from Ben to Dick.

28
00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:57.968
"Do you know her?"

29
00:01:59.269 --> 00:02:00.189
Dick grinned.

30
00:02:00.209 --> 00:02:02.250
"Of course we do!

31
00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:03.530
Hello, Minna!"

32
00:02:06.951 --> 00:02:10.832
"I'll stand up in any court and say she was my wife," Ben said.

33
00:02:10.852 --> 00:02:15.313
"My brother and her father will also testify that she married me."

34
00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:18.494
"He's lying!"

35
00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:19.714
Minna cried.

36
00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:22.295
"I've never seen these guys before."

37
00:02:23.635 --> 00:02:25.516
Ben ignored her protests.

38
00:02:26.476 --> 00:02:27.516
"Where's our boy, Minna?

39
00:02:28.657 --> 00:02:30.158
I'm through with you and so is he.

40
00:02:30.938 --> 00:02:32.819
I'm taking him back to America with me."

41
00:02:34.459 --> 00:02:37.380
At that moment the door leading to the bedroom opened.

42
00:02:38.381 --> 00:02:41.622
A boy who looked just like Ben peeked into the sitting room.

43
00:02:41.642 --> 00:02:43.663
"Look at his chin!"

44
00:02:43.903 --> 00:02:44.563
Dick said.

45
00:02:44.583 --> 00:02:46.984
"I told you he had a scar."

46
00:02:48.365 --> 00:02:50.286
Everyone peered at the boy's chin.

47
00:02:51.486 --> 00:02:53.087
Ben walked over to him.

48
00:02:53.107 --> 00:02:57.416
"Tom, I'm your father, and I'm taking you with me.

49
00:02:58.417 --> 00:02:59.077
Where's your hat?"

50
00:03:00.697 --> 00:03:02.718
The boy pointed to a hat on a chair.

51
00:03:04.278 --> 00:03:06.599
Ben picked it up and took Tom by the hand.

52
00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:12.961
"If you need me again, you know where to find me," Ben said to Mr.

53
00:03:12.981 --> 00:03:16.722
Havisham. He left the room without looking at Minna.

54
00:03:16.742 --> 00:03:18.922
"Stop that man!

55
00:03:19.182 --> 00:03:21.123
He's kidnapping my son!"

56
00:03:21.603 --> 00:03:22.643
Minna screamed.

57
00:03:23.983 --> 00:03:28.662
Just as he'd done before, the earl stayed quiet and stared at Minna.

58
00:03:30.103 --> 00:03:33.005
"We've done some investigating, Minna," Mr.

59
00:03:33.025 --> 00:03:33.946
Havisham said.

60
00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:37.449
"We know you abandoned your son years ago.

61
00:03:38.469 --> 00:03:41.932
Recently you took him from the parents who have raised him.

62
00:03:42.913 --> 00:03:46.716
It's time for you to stop harassing the earl and his family."

63
00:03:48.377 --> 00:03:52.240
Full of fury, Minna went into the bedroom and slammed the door.

64
00:03:53.636 --> 00:03:57.499
"She won't dare show her face around here again," Mr.

65
00:03:57.519 --> 00:03:58.440
Havisham said.

66
00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:02.323
"If she does, she'll be in trouble with the law.

67
00:04:03.463 --> 00:04:06.446
I'll make sure she's on the next train to London."

68
00:04:06.466 --> 00:04:12.070
"As for you, young man The earl turned to Dick.

69
00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.972
"I'll be forever grateful.

70
00:04:15.832 --> 00:04:20.456
You recognized this imposter and stopped her from breaking up my family."

71
00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:24.573
"Mr. Hobbs and I had to help Cedric, sir," Dick said.

72
00:04:24.593 --> 00:04:27.174
"Because everybody likes him!"

73
00:04:27.194 --> 00:04:31.976
"I'll see you at the castle for dinner tonight," the earl said.

74
00:04:31.996 --> 00:04:38.939
"But first I have to tell Lord Fauntleroy—the real Lord Fauntleroy—the good news."

75
00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.661
When the earl arrived at Mrs.

76
00:04:43.741 --> 00:04:46.262
Errol's cottage, she was sitting in the main room.

77
00:04:46.282 --> 00:04:49.603
"Where's Lord Fauntleroy?"

78
00:04:49.943 --> 00:04:50.984
the earl asked.

79
00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.102
Mrs. Errol stepped forward to greet him.

80
00:04:55.122 --> 00:04:58.804
"You mean Cedric is still Lord Fauntleroy?"

81
00:04:58.824 --> 00:05:02.446
"Yes, the matter has been settled."

82
00:05:03.387 --> 00:05:05.048
The earl grasped Mrs.

83
00:05:05.168 --> 00:05:06.449
Errol's hands in his.

84
00:05:06.469 --> 00:05:09.451
"Cedric! Come quickly!"

85
00:05:09.771 --> 00:05:10.932
Mrs. Errol called.

86
00:05:10.952 --> 00:05:13.734
"What is it, Mama?

87
00:05:14.154 --> 00:05:15.015
Is something wrong?"

88
00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:19.398
Cedric ran into the room and flung his arms around her neck.

89
00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:22.560
"Hello, Grandpapa!

90
00:05:23.028 --> 00:05:24.149
What are you doing here?"

91
00:05:24.169 --> 00:05:27.090
"I've come to tell you the good news.

92
00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:31.031
You are the real Lord Fauntleroy."

93
00:05:31.051 --> 00:05:34.593
"Oh, Grandpapa!

94
00:05:35.053 --> 00:05:36.413
I'm so glad!"

95
00:05:37.574 --> 00:05:40.475
Now it was the earl's turn to receive a hug from Cedric.

96
00:05:41.896 --> 00:05:45.077
"I also want you to do me a favor," the earl said.

97
00:05:45.097 --> 00:05:49.038
"Please ask your mother to come with us to the castle."

98
00:05:50.979 --> 00:05:52.600
Cedric's eyes were wide.

99
00:05:53.408 --> 00:05:56.130
"Do you mean to live with us?"

100
00:05:57.832 --> 00:05:58.933
The earl nodded.

101
00:06:00.354 --> 00:06:01.675
Mrs. Errol smiled.

102
00:06:01.695 --> 00:06:05.378
"Are you sure you want me to do that, my lord?"

103
00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:07.200
"Quite sure!"

104
00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:08.441
the earl said.

105
00:06:08.461 --> 00:06:11.343
"Please come as soon as possible."

106
00:06:12.404 --> 00:06:15.406
He looked up as Cedric dashed toward the doorway.

107
00:06:15.426 --> 00:06:18.109
"Where are you going, Cedric?"

108
00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.812
Little Lord Fauntleroy beamed.

109
00:06:22.797 --> 00:06:24.301
"To write to my friend Mr.

110
00:06:24.361 --> 00:06:29.939
Hobbs. I want to tell him everything—and invite him to visit us!"
